what happened to Steve Bannon.

00:03:17.163 --> 00:03:20.700
You know, "Captain Ron,"
if it was a horror movie.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.568
"Last thing I remember is
getting drunk on a yacht,

00:03:22.568 --> 00:03:24.036
