aside

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:57.129
like they're some odd little
personality quirk.

00:04:57.129 --> 00:05:00.800 line:23%
-She's long embraced
conspiracy theories like QAnon,

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:05.004 line:23%
