does not accept.

00:05:30.796 --> 00:05:34.901 line:15%
I reject that, but she's
going to stand for re-election.

00:05:34.901 --> 00:05:36.902 line:15%
I don't think we ought to
punish people

00:05:36.902 --> 00:05:40.906 line:15%
