00:08:07.586 --> 00:08:10.590 line:15%
-President Biden has missed
a historic opportunity

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:13.625 line:15%
to make good on this pledge to
be a president for all Americans

00:08:13.625 --> 00:08:16.229 line:15%
and to stand up and say
the censorship must stop,

00:08:16.229 --> 00:08:18.531 line:21%
the blacklisting must stop.

00:08:18.531 --> 00:08:20.132 line:15%
We have to listen to
and respect

00:08:20.132 --> 00:08:21.700 line:21%
all viewpoints in America.

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:24.603
-Ah, yes, famously bipartisan
Stephen Miller,

00:08:24.603 --> 00:08:27.005
the guy who brought together
the alt and the right.

00:08:27.005 --> 00:08:29.508
The only way I can picture him
reaching across the aisle

00:08:29.508 --> 00:08:33.779
