in a thunderstorm,

00:08:40.952 --> 00:08:42.320
wearing a cape.

00:08:42.320 --> 00:08:44.123
Look, I know it's a favorite
obsession of the media,

00:08:44.123 --> 00:08:46.125
but no one gives a [Bleep]
