to sit down

00:10:12.478 --> 00:10:14.480
and listen to you at all
is more than you deserve.

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:16.048
You know he's getting burned,

00:10:16.048 --> 00:10:17.950
and you know
you're trying to burn him.

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:20.352
But he is gonna keep
holding out hope

00:10:20.352 --> 00:10:22.588
that we can all get along.
That's who he is.

00:10:22.588 --> 00:10:25.157
Joe's the neighbor
who returns the Frisbee

00:10:25.157 --> 00:10:26.525
when some kids
throw it in his yard.

00:10:26.525 --> 00:10:28.260
And then when
they throw it back,

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:30.929
covered in dog crap, and
laugh when he picks it up again,

00:10:30.929 --> 00:10:33.599
he just shakes his head
and says, "I was once like you."

00:10:33.599 --> 00:10:34.833
And then the kids yell back,

00:10:34.833 --> 00:10:36.501
"You were nothing like us,
old man!"

00:10:36.501 --> 00:10:38.537
And before he can answer,
they start circling him

00:10:38.537 --> 00:10:40.205
in their Schwinns,
whooping and hollering

00:10:40.205 --> 00:10:41.974
until he finally starts
getting flustered and yells,

00:10:41.974 --> 00:10:43.976
"Hey, enough is enough."
And the kids yell back,

00:10:43.976 --> 00:10:46.512
"We decide when it's enough!
This is our town now!"

00:10:46.512 --> 00:10:47.813
So then he grabs a stick and

00:10:47.813 --> 00:10:49.515
he jams it in the wheel
of the leader's bike,

00:10:49.515 --> 00:10:52.017
and that kid tumbles harmlessly
into a pile of leaves,

00:10:52.017 --> 00:10:53.585
stands up, brushes himself off,

00:10:53.585 --> 00:10:55.755
and yells, "Well,
that wasn't very bipartisan."

00:10:55.755 --> 00:10:57.356
Seriously, Joe, why on Earth

00:10:57.356 --> 00:11:00.192
are you taking anything
Susan Collins says seriously?

00:11:00.192 --> 00:11:02.661
Just send people the checks.
No one cares

00:11:02.661 --> 00:11:04.896
if she's moderately disappointed
with the process.

00:11:04.896 --> 00:11:07.299
Do you think,
in lieu of a $2,000 check,

00:11:07.299 --> 00:11:09.734
voters would be just as happy
with a postcard that says,

00:11:09.734 --> 00:11:11.904 line:0%
"Rest assured that
Susan Collins' participated

00:11:11.904 --> 00:11:14.306 line:0%
in the legislative process,
was respected,

00:11:14.306 --> 00:11:15.707 line:0%
and her opinion was heard.

00:11:15.707 --> 00:11:18.343 line:0%
As a result, please accept
this $10 gift card to Subway,

00:11:18.343 --> 00:11:20.312 line:0%
applicable only
to the tuna sandwich.

00:11:20.312 --> 00:11:22.715 line:0%
'Tuna' is not
a legally binding term"?

00:11:22.715 --> 00:11:25.851
Republicans rammed through
a $2 trillion tax cut

00:11:25.851 --> 00:11:27.486
for the corporations
and the wealthy,

00:11:27.486 --> 00:11:29.455
and nearly repealed Obamacare,
using the same

00:11:29.455 --> 00:11:31.856
budget reconciliation method
they're now whining about.

00:11:31.856 --> 00:11:34.159
Nothing they say about
compromise and bipartisanship

00:11:34.159 --> 00:11:35.594
should be taken seriously.

00:11:35.594 --> 00:11:37.262
They've been pulling
the same scam for years.

00:11:37.262 --> 00:11:38.697
You know how I know?

00:11:38.697 --> 00:11:41.667
Because Democrats have fallen
for this trap many times before,

00:11:41.667 --> 00:11:44.703
including a certain
vice president in 2012.

00:11:44.703 --> 00:11:46.271 line:23%
-What we need is
the Republican Party.

00:11:46.271 --> 00:11:49.074 line:23%
We need leaders
that can control their party.

00:11:49.074 --> 00:11:50.876 line:23%
And I think you're gonna see
the fever break.

00:11:50.876 --> 00:11:53.412
-Not only did the fever
not break, it got worse,

00:11:53.412 --> 00:11:55.781
probably thanks to that secret
Jewish space laser

00:11:55.781 --> 00:11:57.482
that invented COVID
and hacked the election,

00:11:57.482 --> 00:11:59.218
along with Bill Gates
and Hugo Chávez.

00:11:59.218 --> 00:12:00.752
I see you up there, Space Laser,

00:12:00.752 --> 00:12:02.854
eating your lox,
drinking your Manischewitz.

00:12:02.854 --> 00:12:05.357
Republicans aren't going to
suddenly become reasonable.

00:12:05.357 --> 00:12:07.860
It didn't happen in 2012.
It's not gonna happen now.

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:10.896
Take a cue from incoming Senate
budget chairman Bernie Sanders,

00:12:10.896 --> 00:12:14.199
who was asked on Sunday
about the GOP's bad-faith call

00:12:14.199 --> 00:12:16.868
for bipartisanship, and
immediately brushed it aside.

00:12:16.868 --> 00:12:19.137 line:68%
-Is it a mistake
for Democrats to consider

00:12:19.137 --> 00:12:24.509 line:68%
abandoning bipartisanship
negotiations so soon?

00:12:24.509 --> 00:12:28.580 line:68%
-Martha, the issue is not
bipartisanship or not.

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:32.017 line:68%
The issue is,
are we going to address

00:12:32.017 --> 00:12:36.589 line:68%
the incredible set of crises
and the pain and the anxiety

00:12:36.589 --> 00:12:38.957 line:68%
which is in this country?
You know what?

00:12:38.957 --> 00:12:40.292 line:68%
I don't care
what anybody says,

00:12:40.292 --> 00:12:43.762 line:68%
we have got to deal
with this pandemic.

00:12:43.762 --> 00:12:45.931
-First of all, he's right.
Second, of course,

00:12:45.931 --> 00:12:47.733
Bernie doesn't care
what anybody says.

00:12:47.733 --> 00:12:49.901
He has the energy of a grandpa
who insists on

00:12:49.901 --> 00:12:52.037
shoveling the sidewalk
in his bathrobe.

00:12:52.037 --> 00:12:54.240
"Grandpa, at least
put on some pants."

00:12:54.240 --> 00:12:55.841
"I don't care what anybody says.

00:12:55.841 --> 00:12:58.376
I'm going out there
in my robe and my slippers,

00:12:58.376 --> 00:13:00.078
and if anybody
has a problem with that,

00:13:00.078 --> 00:13:01.880
then they can
talk to the mittens,

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:03.582
because the face
is not listening.

00:13:03.582 --> 00:13:05.851
Not now, not ever."

00:13:05.851 --> 00:13:07.619 line:0%
People need and deserve
immediate help.

00:13:07.619 --> 00:13:09.321 line:0%
They don't have time
for Beltway games

00:13:09.321 --> 00:13:11.590 line:0%
or bad-faith whining
about bipartisanship.

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:13.158
You know
what's actually unifying?

00:13:13.158 --> 00:13:15.093
Doing popular things,
like sending out checks

00:13:15.093 --> 00:13:17.729
and rolling out vaccines
during a pandemic

00:13:17.729 --> 00:13:20.065
and economic crash.
That would get people excited.

00:13:20.065 --> 00:13:22.468
So excited you could be
impeached for...

00:13:22.468 --> 00:13:23.602 line:50%
-Inciting the erection.

00:13:23.602 --> 00:13:26.404
-Oh, that's my time
on the stage.

00:13:26.404 --> 00:13:28.807
I guess I'd better...

00:13:28.807 --> 00:13:33.011
get off.
-♪ Yeah ♪

00:13:33.011 --> 00:13:36.248
Forced it.
[ Laughter ]

